            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a dispenser device for spraying pharmaceutical powder. In the case of using the dispenser device of the present disclosure, a catheter can be prevented from bending, and pharmaceutical powder can be used through a spraying method without fine spray of the powder.</p>
